Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, King of Kings!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you won, but you\Ncan't change the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.43,0:01:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.55,0:01:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's loser talk, chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But Battle City rules state that you\Nonly get my one rarest card if you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm making my own rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me the two rarest cards in your\Ndueling deck and fast! Two cards? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling foul! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, beat it, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Junior, you're talking to the official\Ncommissioner for the Battle City tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I will settle any and\Nall dueling disputes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.87,0:01:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and when it comes to the\Nrules, what I say goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.03,0:01:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.43,0:01:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to stay in this tournament,\Nyou're going to have to do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll have to deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Satokaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.05,0:02:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When you speak to my brother that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.15,0:02:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you dishonor me and the\NBattle City tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.97,0:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I have very\Nlittle patience for bullies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you learned\Nto show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.43,0:02:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with all these rare cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,With one condition,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you must use these rare cards to boost\Nthe dueling power of your pathetic deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,With all these rare cards and my skill,\NThere's no way I'll lose watch out kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're setting yourself up for a fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do. I just\Nneed to play a single
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.35,0:03:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,card to teach you a\Nlesson you won't forget I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon obelisk the tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've never seen a card that powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll use my Egyptian\NGod card on a real opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's the loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No one messes with my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially with an Egyptian\NGod card in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If my plan worked, the other two\Ncards should be here in Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to find out\Nwhere, so I can win them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get hold of all three of these\Nunstoppable Egyptian god monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.97,0:03:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Yugi will be able to defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, I'll be the number\None duelist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.07,0:04:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, so Obelisk the\NTormenter has been played?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, moments ago in Battle City, Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've identified the\Ncard's owner, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.03,0:04:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.87,0:04:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,As Shizu conspires against me, she\Ngave Kaiba that card to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're both after the cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known Shizu was\Nbehind this whole tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been trying to stand in my way ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,since I decided to take\Nwhat is rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open the lid, my servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock the safe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the winged dragon of Ra That makes two One
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:05:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,More Egyptian god card\Nand I'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.07,0:05:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, my millennium necklace warned me\Nyou would betray me And indeed you have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,5,000 years ago, our family swore to\Nprotect the pharaoh's tomb until his return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew that the greatest threat\Nwould come from one of our own?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I protect him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm claiming what should have been\Nmine from the very beginning, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, instead of guarding the\Npharaoh, I'll inherit his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My destiny lies in the cards,\Nthe three Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to carry out this madness,\Nyou're going to have to find the last card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd use your Millennium Rod on\Nyour own flesh and blood, Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue to stand in my\Nway, then yes, I'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my sister gave the third\NEgyptian god card to Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.35,0:06:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She used her Millennium Necklace to\Nforesee the events of Battle City.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Shizu new if she gave\NObelisk the Tormentor to Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd throw a tournament out of greed\Nto obtain the other Egyptian god cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kaiba has little understanding\Nof their true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.63,0:06:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I have them all, the\Npower of the pharaoh will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,However, first I'll need\Nto weaken the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare him for the day\NI take my ultimate prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, shall I order a team of rare\Nhunters to pay Kaiba a little visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, leave Kaiba to his games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.19,0:06:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a more important\Ntask to tend to first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dispatch Arcana to take down Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.95,0:07:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.31,0:07:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go down and see\Nhow Yugi and Joey are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.17,0:07:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Tristan, will you\Npromise me something? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you take me downtown\Nto the Battle City
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Tournament on the day that\NI get my bandages removed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To Battle City?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.26,0:07:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really important to me that the first\Nsight I see is my brother Joey dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch you later
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That was an awesome duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.81,0:07:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey Yeah I'm impressed by how much your\Ndueling skills have improved Thanks a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Well, we're\Noff to find Yugi. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.93,0:07:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,later Good luck
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad Joey let us hang\Non to his Red-Eyes Black
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon That's his favorite\Ncard And now that we have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.29,0:07:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like his heart's in our deck No\Nmatter where we are, Joey will be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we have to face Merrick\Nand his army of rare hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:08:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,we're going to need all\Nthe support we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope that Joey can survive\Nthe tournament without his red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.63,0:08:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey is a great duelist, and he seems\Nto get better with every duel he fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.91,0:08:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He just has to keep believing in himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Joey has come a really\Nlong way since his first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And he just defeated Esperobo\Nwithout needing his red eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.33,0:08:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we need Joey's card to\Nhelp save the world from evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of evil, how will we know\Nwhere Merrick will strike next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't even\Nknow what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.27,0:08:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.57,0:08:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.93,0:08:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out if you walk that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-three steps forward\Nand into that tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My master is waiting for you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.33,0:08:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in your best interest to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no sign of Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there he is, right there. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.43,0:09:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter here, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.97,0:09:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My master's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.57,0:09:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's in a trance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trapped in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.45,0:09:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.36,0:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird. Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The tournament surveillance system\Njust lost track of Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.73,0:09:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure the satellite\Nlink is working now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's Duel Disk sends\Nout a constant ID signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,so wherever he is, his\Nsignal's being blocked somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.37,0:10:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hacking into Battle City database.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Duelist profile for Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dueling level, five stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Rarest card, Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not worthy of having me in your\Ndeck, so prepare to lose me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only duelist\Nwith my power in their deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, and you're certainly not the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time that you met the true\Nmaster of the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.17,0:11:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, enough of these tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.39,0:11:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the illusionist known as Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.79,0:11:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and soon your favorite card\Nwill be dueling for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a true master of illusion\Ndeserves to hold a dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.51,0:11:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You will never understand\Nits full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it must be hard to think of your\Nfavorite card in another duelist's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I challenge you to a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner will take the\Nloser's Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.55,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You must know that when a\Nduelist builds his deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he chooses his favorites from\Nmany different types of cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But sometimes a card can choose a duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The two are connected, and the duelist\Ncan tap into the card's true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because each is bound by\Nthe heart of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Dark Magician has chosen me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.57,0:12:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He has never let me down, And I place\Nmy complete trust in my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.31,0:12:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The great Yugi Moto never\Nbacks down from a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.69,0:12:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But this room's a little\Ncramped, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I know of a special\Nduel ring close by. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.59,0:12:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost curtain time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.39,0:12:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have special orders from my superiors\Nto make this a real spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you have\Norders from your superiors?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who is it that you're\Nworking for, Arcana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.23,0:12:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax and enjoy the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget who's backstage,\Njust worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this deranged showman\Nbe working for Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If he is, then there could be much more\Nat stake here than just my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that door lies my dueling ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I had it specially made for this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.73,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost time to raise the\Ncurtain and start the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy a good matinee, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll notice we're completely alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no screaming\Nfans and no cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's the perfect setting for a private\Nperformance with so much on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.49,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll duel according to\NBattle City Tournament rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to our location, not\Neven Kaiba knows we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's shuffle our decks and\Nlet the show begin, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.39,0:13:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try any sleight of hand, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Card tricks are strictly\Nfor amateurs, Yugi Moto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be sure, I'll\Ncut your deck. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, there is an old saying\Namong high rollers and card sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.77,0:14:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Always trust your opponents, but\Nonly after you've cut their deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's another.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Never trust a masked man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.81,0:14:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you and I are a lot alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We both play to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.77,0:14:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, in this duel performance,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll find there's an\Nextra downside to losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The show, I mean duel,\Nis about to begin! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.45,0:14:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both locked in, which\Nmeans neither of us can escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,See, there's an extra twist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just playing for\Nwhat's inside your deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we're playing for what's inside your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.41,0:15:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dark energy disk, Yu-Gi,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.97,0:15:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and I wouldn't get too close One touch and\Nyour mind's banished to the Shadow Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yugi. I'll explain\Nthe rules to you before you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,See the numbers written\Nabove the energy disks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are life points The\Ncloser the number gets to zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the closer the disc gets to us. Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you can say\Nhello to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now look\Ndown between your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.13,0:15:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see each of us has a key box.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A key box?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.89,0:15:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and inside is a key to unlock\Nthe shackles around your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your box displays your opponent's life
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,points and will only\Nopen if you win the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then can you save\Nyourself. You're insane, think
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:16:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,of it as a hope chest\Nreally because that key is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,your only hope what kind
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.51,0:16:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,of person would toy with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.85,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's mind. Are you some\Nkind of demented madman? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a man who's undefeated\Nnot for long arcana
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.49,0:16:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've met your match, so get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.11,0:16:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to duel, Arcana!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The spotlights on us it's\Nshowtime then draw your cards
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, as expected,\Nmy Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.71,0:16:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't Yugi be surprised when\Nhe sees how easily I drew it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,card tricks may be for amateurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.05,0:17:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but as a duelist, learning how to draw\Nany card any time comes in very handy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.11,0:17:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi will never guess that\NI've manipulated my deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was\Ntrim the edge of certain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,cards to make them slightly\Nsmaller than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.79,0:17:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I trimmed my Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.75,0:17:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it showed up right on top\Nwhen Yugi cut my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly as I planned it would!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yugi will learn how dangerous\Nit is to play games with a magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.51,0:17:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when the stakes are so high!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll start this duel\Nby placing one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.03,0:17:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll summon Alpha the\NMagnet Warrior in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll summon my legion, the Fiend\NJester, also in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I have another monster on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:18:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sacrifice them both to summon\Nmy all-powerful Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be smiling for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To defeat this trickster, I'll have\Nto think like a trickster. Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I don't trust your hand,\NI'll play this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't trust my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.91,0:18:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Card destruction. Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Both players must discard their hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.07,0:18:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan is ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ready to summon my dark magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been deceiving me from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you fixed your first hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So rather than take my chances at falling\Nvictim to another one of your tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed both of our\Nhands so we can discard
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,our old cards and start\Nover with a clean slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.29,0:18:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Say farewell to the cards\Nin your hand, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.89,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that when I claim your Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician and send you to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't count on that yet, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal the face-down card, Brain Control!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.01,0:19:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This card lets me control any of\Nyour monsters, like Fiend Jester!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll sacrifice your Fiend\NJester and my Magnet Warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,which allows me to summon\Nmy ultimate monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Fear the power of my Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,when you believe in the heart of the\Ncards arcana you don't need to cheat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm wide open to an attack by his\Ndark magician you believe in nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,except trickery and winning at all costs\Nbut now you'll see what happens when
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.35,0:19:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you have faith in your cards arcana\Ndark magician show him some real magic
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,With a direct attack on his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already lost more than\Nhalf your life points, Arcana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm still waiting for this\Ngrand magic show you promised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark energy disc is getting closer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be on top now. But he\Nhas no idea of the tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,that are up my sleeve That\Nwas just the opening act,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Before this show's over\NYour mind will be trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
